{"sections":[{"slug":"周环","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"周环"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">周环</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“周环”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">代数簇</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">周环</span></strong> (<span lang=\"zh\">得名于</span><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E7%82%9C%E8%89%AF\" title=\"周炜良 [https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E7%82%9C%E8%89%AF]\"><span lang=\"zh\">周炜良</span></a></span>) $A(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">类比于拓扑空间的上同调环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其元素为子簇</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">模掉有理等价</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">而其乘法结构来自子簇的相交</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">有理等价</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有理等价是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/配边","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">配边</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的代数模拟</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">射影空间</span> $\\mathbb P^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的周环是</span> $A^\\bullet(\\mathbb P^n) = \\mathbb{Z}[\\omega]/(\\omega^{n+1})$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}